टिप्पणी_गर Heavy ALU Stress: Massive Factorial Calculation
मान number = 500
मान factorial = 1

छाप("--- Deep Factorial Stress Test ---")
छाप("Target:")
छाप(number)

जबसम्म (number > 0) {
    मान factorial = factorial * number
    मान number = number - 1
}
छाप("Calculation Complete. Engine survived.")
